                                                "sense_id": "247d7566-ee88-3ba8-805a-f1d04a4ec02c",
                                                "text": "Here a real supper was elegantly served […] with choice wines, particularly white hermitage, which I never before had tasted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67b7e0e4-9a3d-42b1-be89-bf2775bf43a7",
                                                "sense_id": "247d7566-ee88-3ba8-805a-f1d04a4ec02c",
                                                "text": "You will do very well, my lady, very well indeed. I will send you in a couple of dozen of capital sherry, fit for the dons, and some hermitage, by no means to be sneezed at;..."
                                            }
